      "position_suffix": "",
      "page": 2,
      "caption": "Figure 2: Training Framework of SAIPE. SAIPE employs a dual-branch training approach with a shared feature extractor Edown. The LQ input image ILis processed to generate intermediate features Fmid, which feed into two branches. The reconstruction decoderDupoutputsˆIrecandisoptimizedviareconstructionlossLrecagainstthehigh-qualitygroundtruthIH.Theimage guidance embedder Talignproduces semantic image embeddings eimg. To strengthen semantic associations, LLaVA-v1.5-7B generates descriptive text from IL, which is embedded to obtain etext. The alignment loss Lalign enforces semantic consistency between eimgand etextin the embedding space, enabling effective guidance for pre-trained T2I diffusion models.",
      "caption_en": "Figure 2: Training Framework of SAIPE. SAIPE employs a dual-branch training approach with a shared feature extractor Edown. The LQ input image ILis processed to generate intermediate features Fmid, which feed into two branches. The reconstruction decoderDupoutputsˆIrecandisoptimizedviareconstructionlossLrecagainstthehigh-qualitygroundtruthIH.Theimage guidance embedder Talignproduces semantic image embeddings eimg. To strengthen semantic associations, LLaVA-v1.5-7B generates descriptive text from IL, which is embedded to obtain etext. The alignment loss Lalign enforces semantic consistency between eimgand etextin the embedding space, enabling effective guidance for pre-trained T2I diffusion models.",
